## Third-Party Components and Datasets

This software interfaces with, but does not redistribute, the following third-
party datasets and reference materials:

- **PPG-BP dataset** (Liang et al. 2018) — used for training the BP regression
  model. Available from the original authors under the data-use terms of
  Figshare. Not redistributed in this repository.
- **BIDMC PPG and Respiration Dataset** (Pimentel et al. 2016 / PhysioNet) —
  used for cross-dataset SQA evaluation. Available from PhysioNet under the
  ODC Open Database License. Not redistributed in this repository.
- **PPG-DaLiA dataset** (Reiss et al. 2019 / UCI) — used for cross-dataset SQA
  evaluation. Available from UCI Machine Learning Repository under CC BY 4.0.
  Not redistributed in this repository.
- **MAXREFDES117 reference firmware** (Maxim Integrated 2014, now Analog
  Devices) — the SpO2 calibration polynomial originates from this manufacturer
  reference design and is redistributed under the MIT licence in the SparkFun
  MAX3010x Arduino library.

Self-collected cohort PPG recordings (`collected_data/`) are excluded from
this repository for participant privacy.
